<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - J.P. Morgan cuts Monsanto.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - J.P. Morgan cuts Monsanto.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities said analysts Donald Carson and Gilbert Yang downgraded Monsanto Co to market performer from buy.</p>
<p>-- said stock had come within five percent of their $49 price target.</p>
<p>-- &quot;At 23 times estimated 1998 earnings per share, we believe the stock more than adequately reflects the company's near-term and long-term growth prospects,&quot; the analysts said in a report.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 2-1/2 to 43-3/4.</p>
</text>
